/**
 * Applying an existing-Album review, and the identity rows and decisions an apply of its Artist entries and label waits for
 * (owner rules: docs/business-rules.md, Catalog Visibility and Administration). GET /candidates reads the identity rows of the
 * review's default selection; POST /decisions replaces its identity decisions; POST /apply writes the selected saved values in one
 * transaction: the Album's title, date, Artist entries, label and expected tracklist, each Track's title, Disc and Track Number,
 * each selected member's Artist entries, new Artists and label Organizations, MusicBrainz IDs, the automatic Album order and the
 * receipt. Every refusal happens before the first write, and nothing is written on a failure. Album Credits are never copied to
 * members, and member Credits never promote an Artist to the Album. This module loads the review service and value application;
 * it never loads the lookup service or the review lookup requests.
 */
